<前言><![CDATA[]]></前言>
<法規內容>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 1</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[These Standards are established in accordance with Article 14 of the Overseas Compatriot Identity Certification Act.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 2</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The Overseas Community Affairs Council, R.O.C.（TAIWAN） shall charge a fee of NT$250 for each Overseas Compatriot Identity Certificate issued upon application.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 3</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[These Standards shall enter into force on July 1, 2026.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
</法規內容>
</法規>
